WEBVTT

00:00:01.600 --> 00:00:03.970 line:85%
Every forecast is a promise.

00:00:04.270 --> 00:00:06.156 line:85%
In Da Nang, it breaks.

00:00:06.856 --> 00:00:10.440 line:85%
Last autumn, storms cancelled up to forty percent of tours.

00:00:10.690 --> 00:00:13.276 line:85%
Apps tell you the wind. Never what to do.

00:00:14.326 --> 00:00:17.510 line:85%
So we built something that doesn't just predict the weather.

00:00:17.710 --> 00:00:19.129 line:85%
It decides.

00:00:21.079 --> 00:00:23.049 line:85%
Ask the way you'd ask a colleague.

00:00:24.499 --> 00:00:26.685 line:85%
Seven forecasts become one.

00:00:28.135 --> 00:00:31.322 line:85%
Every answer is checked against real safety rules.

00:00:32.772 --> 00:00:35.592 line:85%
When the storm moves in, your plan moves with it.

00:00:37.042 --> 00:00:39.485 line:85%
For the traveler. The builder. The farmer.

00:00:40.635 --> 00:00:43.112 line:85%
Twenty-one percent less forecast error.

00:00:43.262 --> 00:00:45.386 line:85%
Answers in under ten seconds.

00:00:45.536 --> 00:00:47.516 line:85%
Zero safety violations.

00:00:47.966 --> 00:00:51.168 line:85%
Top ten at the Vietnam AI Open Hackathon.

00:00:52.318 --> 00:00:53.562 line:85%
Weatherise.

00:00:53.862 --> 00:00:56.671 line:85%
The best weather is the weather you planned for.
